# {{PROJECT_NAME}} — Components

The index of every component this project publishes for others to use. One row here per component,
and one page per component elsewhere — this file is the way in, not the documentation itself.

**This is a two-artifact role.** This index, and a page per component written to
`COMPONENT-PAGE.md.template` under the schema the component-schema document defines. An index with
no pages is a list of names; pages with no index are unreachable. Scaffold both or neither.

Maintained by whoever adds or changes a published component — in the same change, not after it.

---

## 1. What is in this index, and what is not

A component earns a row here when it is **published**: something outside this project is expected
to use it by name. That is a different bar from "exists in the codebase".

<!-- DECIDE: where is the line in this project? Common answers: everything exported from the
