## 5. What this index does not cover

- **How components go together.** Composition recipes belong in the patterns document; a component
  page describes one piece, and a reader assembling several needs the other document.
- **The values components are built from.** Tokens and their scales belong in the token document.
- **What a consumer must supply per brand.** That belongs in the theming document.

Cross-link to each rather than restating. Two copies of a rule become two different rules.

